{"nodes": [{"id": "strategy_math_test_generatestrategies_money_math", "label": "describe: generateStrategies \u2014 money math", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "__tests__/strategy-math.test.ts", "source_location": "8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Strategy generation across six band/spot configurations that each previously produced inverted legs, negative strikes or NaN money."}, {"id": "strategy_math_test_no_nan_anywhere", "label": "no NaN/undefined anywhere across six band configurations", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "__tests__/strategy-math.test.ts", "source_location": "19", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A very wide band (10..190) used to produce a negative strike and then NaN cost/maxLoss; asserts finite cost, maxLoss, prob in [0,1], positive strikes and finite premium for every generated card."}, {"id": "strategy_math_test_spread_legs_ordered", "label": "spread legs are ordered correctly for their structure", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "__tests__/strategy-math.test.ts", "source_location": "34", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A band entirely below spot used to invert bull call legs and a band entirely above spot inverted bear put legs; pins long<short for debit call spreads, long>short for bear put spreads, Klp<Ksp<Ksc<Klc for condors, and that paired legs never collide on the same strike."}, {"id": "strategy_math_test_long_put_maxprofit_subtracts_premium", "label": "long put max profit subtracts the premium paid", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "__tests__/strategy-math.test.ts", "source_location": "62", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "maxProfit was reported as K*100, ignoring the debit paid; correct value is (K - premium)*100 and must be strictly less than the old wrong figure."}, {"id": "stra